  "intro": [
    "Begin with a fresh story and keep the deterministic replay seed at 1035. Type every numbered command exactly as shown; commands that name a robot change the active voice, so the Auda and Poet commands are explicit.",
    "The route first corrects the planet-side controls, repairs Iris and the Main Supply machine, frees Fred, and replaces the damaged FC cables. Auda listens for the intruders, retrieves their bag, and shuts off the acid spray before Poet enters the Cavernous Room.",
    "The story has no numeric score global. At command 17, SCORE reports 8,000 casualties after 25 cycles. The completed safe route ends at 114,000 current casualties, rank 3, and 29,888,000 possible survivors; the game prints that the Filtering Computers are back in balance and halts successfully.",
    "Item checks: Waldo carries the extension and rough object to Iris; Iris installs the red and yellow ICs, takes the fuse and orange cable, then replaces the fuse; Waldo later carries the wedge, cutter, and red cable; Auda carries the tool bag; Poet carries the camera to the Primary Channel."
  ],
